What is vendored
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The sources under Sources/ copied from other projects (mlx, mlx-c, mlx-swift,
swift-transformers, swift-huggingface, swift-jinja, EventSource, mlx-swift-lm,
mlx.embeddings, and the json, fmt and metal-cpp pins) keep their own licences
